{
  "Scenes.GoblinElder.CastSpell.BlindFlashSpell": "The goblin glares at you and points at you! A bright flash erupts before you! "
  "Scenes.GoblinElder.CastSpell.BlindedStatus": "<b>You are blinded!</b>"
  "Scenes.GoblinElder.CastSpell.BlinkInTime": "You manage to blink in the nick of time!"
  "Scenes.GoblinElder.CastSpell.HealFocusSpell": "She focuses on her body and her desire to end pain, trying to draw on her arousal without enhancing it."
  "Scenes.GoblinElder.CastSpell.LustDrainSpell": "She makes a series of arcane gestures, drawing on her lust to inflict it upon you! "
  "Scenes.GoblinElder.CastSpell.MightEmpowerSpell": "She flushes, drawing on her body's desires to empower her muscles and toughen her up."
  "Scenes.GoblinElder.CastSpell.PowerRush": "The rush of success and power flows through her body. She feels like she can do anything!"
  "Scenes.GoblinElder.CastSpell.SwordChargeSpell": "The goblin utters word of power, summoning an electrical charge around her sword. <b>It looks like she'll deal more physical damage now!</b>"
  "Scenes.GoblinElder.CastSpell.WhiteFireSpell": "The goblin narrows her eyes and focuses her mind with deadly intent. She snaps her fingers and you are enveloped in a flash of white flames!"
  "Scenes.GoblinElder.CastSpell.WoundsKnitHpPlus": "She flushes with success as her wounds begin to knit! <b>(<font color=\"{0}\">+{1}</font>)</b>."
  "Scenes.GoblinElder.ShieldBash.BashAvoided": "You avoid her shield bash!"
  "Scenes.GoblinElder.ShieldBash.ConcussionStun": " The impact from the shield has left you with a concussion. <b>You are stunned.</b>"
  "Scenes.GoblinElder.ShieldBash.ShieldCharge": "The goblin charges at you with her shield! "
  "Scenes.GoblinElder.ShieldBash.ShieldHits": "Her shield hits you!"
  "Scenes.GoblinElder.Slash.SlashAvoided": "You avoid her slash!"
  "Scenes.GoblinElder.Slash.SlashConnects": "Her strike connects with you!"
  "Scenes.GoblinElder.Slash.SwordChargeSlash": "The goblin charges at you with her sword! As soon as she approaches you, she swings her sword! "
  "Scenes.GoblinElder.Won.KickedUnconscious": "You collapse in front of the goblin, too wounded to fight. She growls and kicks you in the head, making your vision swim. As your sight fades, you hear her murmur, [say: Fucking dicks can't even bother to grow a dick or cunt.]"
